### Mechanic: Streak Protocol & Variable Friction
INTENT: reads AttractionConstants.modifiers every frame to apply dynamic friction and handle tower gauge shifts via body destruction and respawn
PSEUDO:
  if IsSensorTriggered(rusty_rails_sensor) then
    SetFriction(puck, AttractionConstants.modifiers.rusty_rails)
  end
  if IsSensorTriggered(curse_sensor) then
    offset = Engine.GetStreak() * AttractionConstants.modifiers.bell_shift
    MoveKinematic(bell, GetPosition(bell).x, GetPosition(bell).y + offset, GetPosition(bell).z, dt)
  end
  if GetPosition(puck).y >= bell.y then
    DestroyBody(puck)
    PoolReturn('puck_pool', puck)
    PoolAcquire('puck_pool', 0, 0, AttractionConstants.modifiers.tower_gauge_offset)
  end
